    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The M-23 Katana is the shotgun most of the galaxy learned on. Ariake Technologies built it for military police and ship security, and decades of surplus have put it in the hands of colonists, mercenaries and pirates alike. It throws a tighter pattern than the Scimitar and reaches a little further, at the cost of a slower rate of fire and a five-shell load.</p><p><strong>Grades:</strong> This weapon rolls one more damage die at elite grade (a greater striking rune in Pathfinder) and a second at paragon grade (major striking).</p>"
